    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-08T18:01:18+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-08T18:01:18+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T07:31:18Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-08T07:31:18Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough and cold front over western SA will track eastwards across the rest of SA on Friday before a weak high briefly establishes in the north on Saturday. Another series of troughs and cold fronts are expected to enter western SA early on Sunday, crossing the state then clearing in the east by the end of Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <warning-summary type="fire_weather_warning" start-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z">Fire Weather Warning for the North East Pastoral fire weather district for Friday</warning-summary>
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-08T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds north to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the late morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding west of Leigh Creek in the morning and afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h turning north to northwesterly 35 to 50 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 38.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Extreme</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the far northeast in the afternoon and evening. Winds northwest to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending southeast to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h before dawn. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 24 to 33.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Leigh Creek, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning then tending northerly 25 to 40 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 37.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-13T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-12T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h shifting south to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
